      en: ["The park spans a total area of 471 hectares", "It was granted national park status in 2003", "There are over 100 distinct species of coral", "The islands are located 1 km off the Nilaveli coast", "Blacktip reef sharks are frequently sighted here", "Named after the rock pigeons inhabiting the islands"],
